      "statement": "/evaluate is auth-gated with x-api-key matched against EVALUATE_TOKEN via secrets.compare_digest; it accepts arbitrary text and is closed to prevent a free LLM call. It is one of several auth-gated endpoints: /digest and /digest/sent use N8N_DEDUPE, and /askeval uses EVALS, all via the same keycheck helper.",
