      "statement": "Redis serves three concerns: a per-query job cache (jobs:{query}:{country}, 14400s ex), rate-limit storage for slowapi (with in-memory fallback), and a daily Gemini-call budget (gemini_calls:{name}:{date}, 86400s expire) that triggers HTTP 429 when limits (site=100) are exceeded.",
