    {
      "id": "claim_6ab0c09fda324151a6f320b75c610c95",
      "statement": "The n8n digest loop consists of POST /digest, which runs the shared graph search and then deduplicates filtered jobs against the Postgres n8njobs table (returning {md, links} for unsent links), and POST /digest/sent, which records the links n8n delivered by inserting into n8njobs with on-conflict-do-nothing; both are gated by N8N_DEDUPE.",
